c_14_profile_and_account_locationpickersection", "label": "LocationPickerSection", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/kmp-spec/14-profile-and-account.md", "source_location": "\u00a73.3", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_kmp_spec_14_profile_and_account_phoneinputfield", "label": "PhoneInputField", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/kmp-spec/14-profile-and-account.md", "source_location": "\u00a73.4", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_kmp_spec_14_profile_and_account_parsefullphone_bug", "label": "parseFullPhone 4-digit dial code bug (Q10)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/kmp-spec/14-profile-and-account.md", "source_location": "\u00a73.4", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Heuristic always takes a 4-digit dial code so +998 numbers lose a digit; port should use libphonenumber or match known dial codes longest-first."}, {"id": "docs_kmp_spec_14_profile_and_account_useravatar", "label": "UserAvatar widget", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/kmp-spec/14-profile-and-account.md", "source_location": "\u00a73.6", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_kmp_spec_14_profile_and_account_languageminitoggle", "label": "LanguageMiniToggle", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/kmp-spec/14-profile-and-account.md", "source_location": "\u00a73.6", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Login-screen toggle does not PATCH the backend, so the ProfileScreen listener may later flip the app back to the server language (Q18)."}, {"id": "docs_kmp_spec_14_profile_and_account_appversionfooter", "label": "AppVersionFooter", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/kmp-spec/14-profile-and-account.md", "source_location": "\u00a73.6", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_kmp_spec_14_profile_and_account_profileprovider", "label": "profileProvider (ProfileNotifier)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/kmp-spec/14-profile-and-account.md", "source_location": "\u00a76.1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_kmp_spec_14_profile_and_account_languageprovider", "label": "languageProvider", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/kmp-spec/14-profile-and-account.md", "source_location": "\u00a76.2", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Port: CMP has no runtime locale switch, so apply locale via own LocalAppLocale; only accept en|de|uz|ru from server and do not let unknown values force English."}, {"id": "docs_kmp_spec_14_profile_and_account_patientprofilemodel", "label": "PatientProfileModel", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/kmp-spec/14-profile-and-account.md", "source_location": "\u00a75.1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_kmp_spec_14_profile_and_account_deleteaccountrequestresult", "label": "DeleteAccountRequestResult", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/kmp-spec/14-profile-and-account.md", "source_location": "\u00a75.3", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_kmp_spec_14_profile_and_account_applanguage", "label": "AppLanguage enum", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/kmp-spec/14-profile-and-account.md", "source_location": "\u00a75.4", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_kmp_spec_14_profile_and_account_normalizephotourl", "label": "normalizePhotoUrl", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/kmp-spec/14-profile-and-account.md", "source_location": "\u00a75.2", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_kmp_spec_14_profile_and_account_withcachebuster", "label": "withCacheBuster", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/kmp-spec/14-profile-and-account.md", "source_location": "\u00a75.2", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_kmp_spec_14_profile_and_account_googlegeocodingservice", "label": "GoogleGeocodingService", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/kmp-spec/14-profile-and-account.md", "source_location": "\u00a74.8", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Debug log prints the full URL including the API key (Q6); never embed keys in the port, fetch from /api/public/config."}, {"id": "docs_kmp_spec_14_profile_and_account_accountdeletionrepository", "label": "AccountDeletionRepository", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/kmp-spec/14-profile-and-account.md", "source_location": "\u00a74.4", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_kmp_spec_14_profile_and_account_profilerepository", "label": "ProfileRepository", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/kmp-spec/14-profile-and-account.md", "source_location": "\u00a79", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Port puts it in common code (Ktor) with explicitNulls=false so only set keys are PATCHed, and moves photo upload out of the widget."}, {"id": "docs_kmp_spec_14_profile_and_account_profilestore", "label": "ProfileStore (KMP)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/kmp-spec/14-profile-and-account.md", "source_location": "\u00a79", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Singleton StateFlow shared app-wide; separate isRefreshing/isSaving flags so a PATCH does not blank the whole profile page (fixes Q13)."}, {"id": "docs_kmp_spec_14_profile_and_account_delete_account_flow", "label": "Delete Account Email OTP Flow", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/kmp-spec/14-profile-and-account.md", "source_location": "\u00a72.2", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Keep 3-call sequence request -> send-email-otp -> confirm; use expiresInSeconds for countdown instead of hardcoded 300 s; await logout after success."}, {"id": "docs_kmp_spec_14_profile_and_account_avatar_upload_flow", "label": "Avatar Upload Flow", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/kmp-spec/14-profile-and-account.md", "source_location": "\u00a72.3", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_kmp_spec_14_profile_and_account_location_picking_flow", "label": "Location Picking Flow", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/kmp-spec/14-profile-and-account.md", "source_location": "\u00a72.4", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Port should emit coordinates even when geocoding fails and consider passing app language instead of en."}, {"id": "docs_kmp_spec_14_profile_and_account_timezone_sync", "label": "Timezone Sync (syncTimeZoneFromDevice)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/kmp-spec/14-profile-and-account.md", "source_location": "\u00a76.3", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Runs on auth and every resume; before profile loads it always PATCHes once per cold start, so port should wait for profile load before comparing."}, {"id": "docs_kmp_spec_14_profile_and_account_logout_routine", "label": "Logout Routine", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/kmp-spec/14-profile-and-account.md", "source_location": "\u00a73.1.2", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Port should await FCM-token clear and token wipe before navigating and reset ProfileStore and all user-scoped stores (profileProvider is not reset in Flutter)."}, {"id": "docs_kmp_spec_14_profile_and_account_permission_rationale_dialog", "label": "Permission Rationale Dialog", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/kmp-spec/14-profile-and-account.md", "source_location": "\u00a73.3", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "No cancel option, per Apple guideline 5.1.1(iv)."}, {"id": "docs_kmp_spec_14_profile_and_account_subscription_tier_gate", "label": "Shifa AI Subscription Tier Gate", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/kmp-spec/14-profile-and-account.md", "source_location": "\u00a74.1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "features (PATIENT_SHIFA_AI) wins over tier in the provider but the router gate uses only the tier; missing/unknown tier parses as PREMIUM."}, {"id": "docs_kmp_spec_14_profile_and_account_q1_local_photo_path_quirk", "label": "Q1 Edit-profile photo sends local path", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/kmp-spec/14-profile-and-account.md", "source_location": "\u00a710", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_kmp_spec_14_profile_and_account_q2_formdata_reuse_quirk", "label": "Q2 Photo upload fallback reuses finalized FormData", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/kmp-spec/14-profile-and-account.md", "source_location": "\u00a710", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_kmp_spec_14_profile_and_account_q4_free_text_language_quirk", "label": "Q4 Free-text language field", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/kmp-spec/14-profile-and-account.md", "source_location": "\u00a710", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_kmp_spec_14_profile_and_account_q5_map_selection_lost_quirk", "label": "Q5 Map selection silently lost without Google key", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/kmp-spec/14-profile-and-account.md", "source_l